<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:41:08Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>法國多地抗議變暴力衝突 巴黎街頭滿是焚毀汽車和碎玻璃</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq8ez1wny72xo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T11:28:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq8ez1wny72xo/trad--fbeac9591057.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq8ez1wny72xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">法國全國多座城市反對生活成本上漲的抗議活動爆發暴力和破壞行為後，約有1800人被捕。</summary></entry><entry><title>遊艇上的水上滑梯、泳池：衛星影像揭示的金正恩「夏宮」生活</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:31:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad--0bc0150d063e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC追蹤了一艘長達80米、配有水上滑梯的船隻，旨在進一步了解金正恩如何度過假期——這對大多數朝鮮人而言，是遙不可及的體驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>在美中國研究生涉毒害越南同學：大學與家屬怎麼說？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:31:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad--cdb291b8461c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國懷俄明大學一名越南籍研究生的家屬向BBC表示，受害人在辦公室的咖啡機內發現神經毒劑後，至今仍出現疲倦、食慾不振及睡眠欠佳等健康問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我擔心得不敢去中國了」：韓國脫北者接連收到警方赴華警告</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T12:54:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad--f0359e5428ca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">為何已在韓國定居的脫北者，如今對前往中國感到憂慮？BBC深入了解韓國警方發出旅遊警告的背景，以及脫北者實際遭中國當局拒絕入境的個案。</summary></entry><entry><title>在這極速超越高鐵的賽車運動裏，女性車手盡展鋒芒</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr15jlq50vq5o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:41:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T09:09:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr15jlq50vq5o/trad--f7a41c275715.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr15jlq50vq5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Top Fuel 直線競速是目前唯一一個女性經常擊敗男性、贏得重要冠軍頭銜的頂級賽車運動組別。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我申請了200份工作」——用AI「撒網」求職為何易弄巧成拙？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:32:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad--657a0d83de2b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">研究發現越來越多畢業生利用人工智慧在求職申請中編造個人資訊。但有人認為他們別無選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>上任僅五天便下台，特朗普的白宮新聞秘書出了甚麼問題？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yng42z0dlo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T05:43:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yng42z0dlo/trad--b8428d15e661.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yng42z0dlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC駐北美記者分析，距離關鍵的國會中期選舉只剩幾個星期，白宮正面臨愈來愈多的挑戰。</summary></entry><entry><title>石油出口放緩之際 霍爾木茲海峽輪船遇襲案件創新高</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T11:44:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad--0dc49909270d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC事實查核（BBC Verify）對英國海事機構數據的分析顯示，過去一星期內有12艘船隻遭到襲擊。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國製造的玩具如何從工廠到美國？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T00:27:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad--904bb526e85b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聖誕節臨近，我們追蹤兒童玩具從中國工廠到美國貨架的整個過程。</summary></entry><entry><title>哈里與梅根返英後首次亮相，為何如此像一場正式王室活動？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yn7plnlllo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T08:14:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yn7plnlllo/trad--6cfe3551500d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck5yn7plnlllo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">薩塞克斯公爵伉儷已經好幾年沒有在英國本土舉辦過類似諾丁漢當天那樣的活動了。</summary></entry><entry><title>法國總統大選前，學生抗議活動是否被人為操縱？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gxl2jxlo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T06:21:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gxl2jxlo/trad--eafade61837c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gxl2jxlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">法國總理暗示學生的憤怒情緒正被武器化，因為工會和其他抗議者也準備走上街頭。法國是否瀕臨崩潰？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉2026：贏會贏在哪裏，輸會輸在哪裏？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad--14c6dc46283f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC深入分析將界定特朗普總統任期最後兩年的選舉前景，包括關鍵民調、選戰以及議題。</summary></entry><entry><title>令人窒息的有毒霧霾蔓延東南亞，誰之過？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad--574ceaf17d79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對被指控在印尼焚燒土地的企業，以及未能阻止這些行為的當局，人們的憤怒情緒正不斷升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>美沙冬是毒還是藥？從香港經驗看台灣選戰戒毒爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T08:57:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad--3e0e93250f10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台北市長選舉引發對「美沙冬」（香港稱「美沙酮」）與毒品減害政策的論戰，然而在海峽對岸的香港，這項計劃已運作超過半世紀。為什麼醫學界將其視為有效降低犯罪與血液傳染病的「減害」關鍵？</summary></entry><entry><title>新鴨綠江大橋閒置12年終開通：中朝關係回暖？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:46:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad--fac779159e2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國與朝鮮的鴨綠江大橋，在閒置12年之後終於正式開通。近年朝鮮與俄羅斯關係愈走愈近，專家分析中方需要透過開通大橋鞏固對朝關係，也被視為關係回暖的象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣AV盛極而衰：中國市場如何催生這場成人片熱潮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T09:37:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad--38da8fdcbc19.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣曾被視為亞洲唯一能合法拍攝無碼成人影片的地區，並在2020年前後快速擴張。隨著片商「麻豆傳媒」停運，外界開始質疑這波繁榮是否與中國市場及博弈資金有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>薄熙來前搭檔受查：重慶政壇「不倒翁」黃奇帆是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:46:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad--7b329579f173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共中紀委宣佈，已退出政壇多年的前重慶市長黃奇帆涉嫌「嚴重違紀違法」，正接受調查。此消息正值中共五中全會前夕，引發外界關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>賴清德雙十講話：台灣強化防衛不是放棄對話</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T05:01:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad--c3d85a63fdbb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣舉行2026年雙十國慶大會，總統賴清德講話引用基督教《聖經》提出要建設「山巔之城」，讓台灣成為「維護印太和平與穩定的關鍵力量」。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>從今以後，不擇手段？普京新策略要讓烏克蘭全國片瓦無存</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T09:09:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad--f930cb1fb79d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從學校、醫院、酒店、數據中心、火車到橋樑，俄羅斯近數星期加強以導彈和無人機襲擊烏克蘭首都及其他主要城市，攻擊民用目標。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國和印度不算老友，尼泊爾想團結他們應對氣候威脅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T05:50:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad--c4314e8bb4de.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">尼泊爾能否促成這兩個區域大國攜手應對喜馬拉雅山脈共同面臨的氣候威脅？</summary></entry><entry><title>中共中央紀委：薄熙來前搭檔黃奇帆接受調查</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T13:34:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad--9b407cfe729a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃奇帆擔任重慶市長期間，上級薄熙來與同僚王立軍系列醜聞爆發。離任後，他仍以經濟學家身分周遊演說。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉是甚麼？這是一份簡易指南</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T04:41:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad--30e500462b02.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國選民將於11月3日前往投票，這場選舉的結果可能對唐納德·特朗普（川普）的總統任期產生重大影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>「黑珍珠」瑪麗亞：表演中國川劇的塞拉利昂女子</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T00:17:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad--57835275c3d9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">瑪麗亞夢想成為一名歌手和表演者。多年後，她前往中國參加一場選美比賽，並在火車上獲一名陌生人意外伸出援手後，最終在那裏建立了自己的生活。</summary></entry><entry><title>中朝新鴨綠江大橋通車：北京、平壤與莫斯科的新格局</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T11:39:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad--010dc4677c88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國丹東與朝鮮新義州的新鴨綠江大橋建成12年後正式通車。大橋此前遭長期閒置，被觀察人士視為中朝關係起伏的一個象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉解讀：「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我會跟電視說話」：中國這些孤獨的人付錢感受溫暖</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T08:42:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad--1a5d60068ad9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著中國孤獨感的加劇，一個提供陪伴和支持的新興產業正在興起。</summary></entry><entry><title>華為尊界V800事件：一場煞車測試如何演變成中國輿論風暴</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T09:04:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad--47059d36e1c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近期，中國知名車媒懂車帝發布對尊界V800的實測影片，顯示多輛測試車在緊急制動過程中出現制動踏板支架斷裂，事件迅速引發輿論關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國民兵船「首現台灣東部海域」意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T05:31:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad--89d511d9a7e5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一艘被辨識為中國海上民兵船的漁船，8月在台灣東部外海與另外兩艘中國船隻共同活動。軍事學者向BBC中文分析，這類船隻可能有海上監控、情報蒐集等任務。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我今年12歲，該嘗試蛋白粉嗎？」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T09:28:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad--5568a26dfd87.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC詢問專家，兒童和青少年服用蛋白質補充劑是否安全。</summary></entry><entry><title>減肥針「微劑量」用藥漸成風潮：注射少量真的安全嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T06:09:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad--7673e2d42b97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些人正以小劑量方式使用「胰妥讚」、「週纖達」等GLP-1類藥物。使用者表示，這種方法既能幫助減重，又能減少副作用和節省開支。不過，專家指出，目前幾乎沒研究證據支持這種做法，而且可能存在危險。</summary></entry><entry><title>AI翻譯：還有多久會完全取代人類？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T02:38:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad--de11ca890e71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人工智能已主導翻譯行業，但高風險的範疇仍然需要人類，例如法律、醫療等領域。</summary></entry><entry><title>人類身高的起伏變化：哪些歷史事件影響最大？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad--d25b147665fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如今我們的身高比100年前高了大約10厘米，但這並非一帆風順。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼是「微笑抑鬱」？如何察覺徵兆？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-18T12:40:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T00:41:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad--9fcc094e0ba0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果你表面上看起來很快樂，內心卻飽受煎熬，你可能患有非典型抑鬱症。然而，隱藏真實感受可能對心理健康造成傷害。</summary></entry></feed>
